{"title":"2025 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(fast_version_of_Solution_x)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (fast version of Solution x)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_DDM\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by DDM</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Continuum_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Continuum Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1_by_Math-X_(First_fully_understand_the_problem!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1 by Math-X (First fully understand the problem!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2_(Detailed_Explanation)_🚀⚡📊\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2 (Detailed Explanation) 🚀⚡📊</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_3Super_Easy_to_understand_and_very_knowledgeable\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 3Super Easy to understand and very knowledgeable</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Pi_Academy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Pi Academy</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_4_by_SpreadTheMathLove\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 4 by SpreadTheMathLove</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_7_by_Thinking_Feet\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">14</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 7 by Thinking Feet</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_8_by_CoolMathProblems\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">15</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 8 by CoolMathProblems</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-16\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution(Quick,_fast,_easy!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">16</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution(Quick, fast, easy!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-17\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">17</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-18\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_in_Chinese_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">18</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution in Chinese by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-19\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">19</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The table below shows the ancient Egyptian hieroglyphs that were used to represent different numbers.\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:Mathh.PNG\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/de/Mathh.PNG\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"304\" height=\"85\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p><p>For example, the number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/4/4f4b8590f8aa9f9894b3891dd5dede0e354fa04e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> was represented by the hieroglyphs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/3/8d3795df7163cf90eb6b0091d2382c7d03ed2b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cap \\cap \\cap ||$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"56\" height=\"20\" />. What number is represented by the following combination of hieroglyphs?\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:Amc8_2025_prob_2_pic.PNG\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/3/38/Amc8_2025_prob_2_pic.PNG\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"170\" height=\"65\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/a/31ad9faff5cce23d6e74e6bde205004dfc2bf907.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 1,423 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 10,423 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 14,023 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 14,203 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 14,230$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"564\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The first hieroglyph is worth <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/b/50b19142d92b7b4f1a115c4ec91766582e2b8faf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10,000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"55\" height=\"17\" />, the next 4 are worth <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/6/fa6fa96400fa2f29c00363c7ec7f0338792b5e06.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100 \\cdot 4 = 400$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"103\" height=\"14\" />, the next <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> are worth <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/1/1d161b110757f2644db7e6c7e1974a890b9d411c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10 \\cdot 2 = 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"82\" height=\"13\" />, and the last <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> are worth <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/a/00a20b767849cee13416485a444f627c8330e181.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\cdot 3 = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"64\" height=\"13\" />. Therefore, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/6/f262c1c592084f33e75aefc128c5872fbb3e0f84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10,000 + 400 + 20 + 3 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 10,423}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"300\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\\( 1 \\cdot 10^4 + 0 \\cdot 10^3 + 4 \\cdot 10^2 + 2 \\cdot 10^1 + 3 \\cdot 10^0 = 10423 \\)\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28fast_version_of_Solution_x.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(fast_version_of_Solution_x)\">Solution 3 (fast version of Solution x)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (fast version of Solution x)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From a first inspection, you may notice that there is no thousands hieroglyph. The only option with zero in the thousands place is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/8/f387841a259a8d91c994cdf9a526fec437fd961c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 10,423}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"101\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~thatmathsguy\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//youtu.be/rjd0gigUsd0\">~Thesmartgreekmathdude</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_DDM\">Video Solution by DDM</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by DDM\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/5Jak6VUDojA\">https://youtu.be/5Jak6VUDojA</a>\n</p><p>~piggydude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Continuum_Math\">Video Solution by Continuum Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Continuum Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/mBYYaoPQsbs&amp;t=36\">https://youtu.be/mBYYaoPQsbs&amp;t=36</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_1_by_Math-X_.28First_fully_understand_the_problem.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1_by_Math-X_(First_fully_understand_the_problem!!!)\">Video Solution 1 by Math-X (First fully understand the problem!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1 by Math-X (First fully understand the problem!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/VUL0T0YEAHk?si=Zlm-a5bskoTeEQv6&amp;t=127\">https://youtu.be/VUL0T0YEAHk?si=Zlm-a5bskoTeEQv6&amp;t=127</a>\n~Math-X\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_2_.28Detailed_Explanation.29_.F0.9F.9A.80.E2.9A.A1.F0.9F.93.8A\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2_(Detailed_Explanation)_🚀⚡📊\">Video Solution 2 (Detailed Explanation) 🚀⚡📊</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2 (Detailed Explanation) 🚀⚡📊\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=j20JsyEXKcs\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=j20JsyEXKcs</a>\n</p><p>~ ChillThingz&#160;:)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_3Super_Easy_to_understand_and_very_knowledgeable\">Video Solution 3Super Easy to understand and very knowledgeable</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 3Super Easy to understand and very knowledgeable\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/U_jbKGRR2Ww\">https://youtu.be/U_jbKGRR2Ww</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Pi_Academy\">Video Solution by Pi Academy</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Pi Academy\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Iv_a3Rz725w?si=E0SI_h1XT8msWgkK\">https://youtu.be/Iv_a3Rz725w?si=E0SI_h1XT8msWgkK</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_4_by_SpreadTheMathLove\">Video Solution 4 by SpreadTheMathLove</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 4 by SpreadTheMathLove\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jTTcscvcQmI\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jTTcscvcQmI</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_5\">Video Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=13\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//youtu.be/VP7g-s8akMY?si=eptV4vO-YstwSQy1&amp;t=105\">~hsnacademy</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_7_by_Thinking_Feet\">Video Solution 7 by Thinking Feet</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=14\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 7 by Thinking Feet\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/PKMpTS6b988\">https://youtu.be/PKMpTS6b988</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_8_by_CoolMathProblems\">Video Solution 8 by CoolMathProblems</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=15\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 8 by CoolMathProblems\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/biB8GlB54oI\">https://youtu.be/biB8GlB54oI</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution.28Quick.2C_fast.2C_easy.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution(Quick,_fast,_easy!